  "post_title": "El Museo de la Baronía de Ribesalbes acoge las pinturas de Lorena Boix y Pere Sales",
  "post_date": "2019-02-18 23:46:26",
  "post_name": "el-museo-de-la-baronia-de-ribesalbes-acoge-las-pinturas-de-lorena-boix-y-pere-sales",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias|Política",
  "post_content": "<p style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\"><font color=\"#000000\">(30 fotos) El Museo de la Baron&iacute;a de Ribesalbes acoge hasta el 2 de marzo una nueva exposici&oacute;n pict&oacute;rica, con obras de Lorena Boix, que llevan por t&iacute;tulo Emociones, y de Pere Sales, bajo el ep&iacute;grafe &lsquo;Aromes de mar&rsquo;.</font></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/02/IMG_0472.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\"><font color=\"#000000\">Antes de la inauguraci&oacute;n la ma&ntilde;ana del s&aacute;bado se ha guardado un minuto de silencio por Carlos Monfort Solsona, fallecido hace justo una semana a los 37 a&ntilde;os y colaborador incansable del Museo.</font></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\"><font color=\"#000000\">El alcalde, C&eacute;sar Pallar&eacute;s Torres, ha destacado que la instalaci&oacute;n muse&iacute;stica organiza muchas exposiciones a los largo del a&ntilde;o, &ldquo;sin duda, el que m&aacute;s de la provincia de Castell&oacute;n&rdquo;. </font></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\"><font color=\"#000000\">La muestra puede verse de martes a viernes de 9 a 14 horas y el s&aacute;bado, de 10 a 14 horas.</font></span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpolorenaboixperesalesribesalbes/img_0453.jpg\" alt=\"img_0453\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpolorenaboixperesalesribesalbes/img_0455.jpg\" alt=\"img_0455\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpolorenaboixperesalesribesalbes/img_0457.jpg\" alt=\"img_0457\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpolorenaboixperesalesribesalbes/img_0459.jpg\" alt=\"img_0459\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpolorenaboixperesalesribesalbes/img_0461.jpg\" alt=\"img_0461\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpolorenaboixperesalesribesalbes/img_0462.jpg\" alt=\"img_0462\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpolorenaboixperesalesribesalbes/img_0464.jpg\" alt=\"img_0464\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpolorenaboixperesalesribesalbes/img_0465.jpg\" alt=\"img_0465\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpolorenaboixperesalesribesalbes/img_0467.jpg\" alt=\"img_0467\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpolorenaboixperesalesribesalbes/img_0469.jpg\" alt=\"img_0469\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpolorenaboixperesalesribesalbes/img_0470.jpg\" alt=\"img_0470\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpolorenaboixperesalesribesalbes/img_0472.jpg\" alt=\"img_0472\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpolorenaboi